00:57:35.986 --> 00:57:39.986
Last week I gave a big introduction about what happened on Mount Hermon.

193
00:57:40.986 --> 00:57:45.986
Namely, I said last week, and here is a little recap for those who were not here last week, God will bless you.

194
00:57:46.986 --> 00:57:55.986
But last week I said that Jesus arrived in Caesarea Philippi.

195
00:57:56.986 --> 00:58:00.986
He went there, of course, under the guidance of the Holy Spirit.

196
00:58:01.986 --> 00:58:11.986
And Jesus came to a very occult area, where the ancient god Baal and the Greek god Pan demanded human sacrifices.

197
00:58:12.986 --> 00:58:15.986
And Jesus stands there, namely, on Mount Hermon.

198
00:58:16.986 --> 00:58:19.986
And he says to his disciples, who do people say that I am?

199
00:58:20.986 --> 00:58:25.986
And then the disciples say, yes, some say that you are John the Baptist, some say that you are Elijah.

200
00:58:26.986 --> 00:58:29.986
And then Jesus says, but who do you say that I am?

201
00:58:29.986 --> 00:58:38.986
And Simon Peter steps forward and Simon Peter says to Jesus, you are the Messiah, the Son of the living God.

202
00:58:39.986 --> 00:58:43.986
And why does Jesus do that at that point?

203
00:58:44.986 --> 00:58:48.986
Why does Jesus ask this question on this mountain?

204
00:58:48.986 --> 00:58:58.986
And last week I showed that 2500 years ago, or 2000 years ago, there were the angels, the sun gods.

205
00:58:59.986 --> 00:59:01.986
That is an important word that you need to learn from the Bible.

206
00:59:02.986 --> 00:59:07.986
The sun gods are the angels of the heavenly realms.

207
00:59:08.986 --> 00:59:10.986
The angels of God are the sun gods.

208
00:59:11.986 --> 00:59:12.986
The Bible also sometimes refers to them as the stars.

209
00:59:12.986 --> 00:59:21.986
So sometimes when you read something about stars, you should ask yourself whether we are talking about heavenly spirits or whether we are talking about physical stars.

210
00:59:22.986 --> 00:59:25.986
The Bible has a different style of writing.

211
00:59:26.986 --> 00:59:38.986
And if you ask me, it is actually beautiful and awe-inspiring when you start learning from great people today about what those depths look like.

212
00:59:38.986 --> 00:59:45.986
That creates for me awe, this is why they wrote it there and this is what it means there.

