246
01:03:41.986 --> 01:03:44.986
They want to lead you somewhere.

247
01:03:44.986 --> 01:03:49.986
But the word 'mis' is in front of it, which means it's not going in the right direction.

248
01:03:49.986 --> 01:03:54.986
It is a distraction from the love of God.

249
01:03:54.986 --> 01:03:56.986
But this is what you need to know about demons.

250
01:03:56.986 --> 01:03:59.986
And about deceptions in general.

251
01:04:02.986 --> 01:04:08.986
