252
01:04:08.986 --> 01:04:13.986
That is why it is also deception.

253
01:04:13.986 --> 01:04:16.986
It doesn't make sense.

254
01:04:16.986 --> 01:04:19.986
It wouldn't make sense.

255
01:04:19.986 --> 01:04:26.986
Even if I were to show you a trick that wouldn't make you happy, that would make you sick anyway,

256
01:04:26.986 --> 01:04:30.986
