258
01:04:34.986 --> 01:04:39.986
Then you would say, yes, no, I actually don't see the point in that.

259
01:04:39.986 --> 01:04:42.986
So then deception makes no sense.

260
01:04:42.986 --> 01:04:48.986
Deception is always based on something that has a bit of overlap.

261
01:04:48.986 --> 01:04:52.986
Do you know what the serpent does in the tree with Eve?

262
01:04:52.986 --> 01:04:57.986
He says to Eve, the first woman, he says to Eve,

263
01:04:58.986 --> 01:05:04.986
