264
01:05:04.986 --> 01:05:09.986
Yes, says Eve, that's true, but she is like, blah, blah, blah.

265
01:05:09.986 --> 01:05:13.986
And then the serpent says, no, that's not true.

266
01:05:13.986 --> 01:05:16.986
So there you have a piece of deception.

267
01:05:16.986 --> 01:05:21.986
He takes his place in a tree, he shows, and then the Bible says,

268
01:05:21.986 --> 01:05:27.986
And the woman saw how beautiful the fruits were, how desirable the fruits were.

269
01:05:27.986 --> 01:05:37.986
So here it is, you want something badly, you want peace, but the way to it, that's the trick.

270
01:05:37.986 --> 01:05:45.986
The way to peace, the way in your life to health.

271
01:05:45.986 --> 01:05:51.986
