290
01:07:14.986 --> 01:07:20.986
to have to adhere to all the rules of the Bible, old book, and I have to go to church,

291
01:07:20.986 --> 01:07:24.986
and I had a fun party last night, drank too much, and now I have to get out of bed,

292
01:07:24.986 --> 01:07:26.986
and I really don't feel like it.

293
01:07:26.986 --> 01:07:30.986
