393
01:14:05.986 --> 01:14:09.986
And that is a glorious concept.

394
01:14:09.986 --> 01:14:15.986
That if you come to understand that, then you know that you are a victor in the name of Jesus.

395
01:14:15.986 --> 01:14:17.986
Amazing.

396
01:14:17.986 --> 01:14:19.986
I do not need to be a victor.

397
01:14:19.986 --> 01:14:21.986
I have a victor in my life.

398
01:14:21.986 --> 01:14:26.986
I can fail, but I can believe in someone who has never failed.

399
01:14:26.986 --> 01:14:28.986
He who rose from the dead.

400
01:14:28.986 --> 01:14:31.986
