Let us be the church of Jesus Christ.

908
01:46:13.986 --> 01:46:15.986
Be busy in prayer.

909
01:46:15.986 --> 01:46:17.986
For we have a King.

910
01:46:17.986 --> 01:46:18.986
Shall we close our eyes?

911
01:46:18.986 --> 01:46:21.986
We have a King who loves us.

912
01:46:21.986 --> 01:46:24.986
We have a King who is victorious.

913
01:46:24.986 --> 01:46:27.986
We have a King who has granted victories

914
01:46:27.986 --> 01:46:30.986
over the authorities and powers of Satan.

915
01:46:30.986 --> 01:46:32.986
But we also have a King who has granted victories

916
01:46:32.986 --> 01:46:34.986
over your sins.

917
01:46:34.986 --> 01:46:37.986
He died on a cross on a mountain

918
01:46:37.986 --> 01:46:39.986
for your and my mistakes.

919
01:46:39.986 --> 01:46:40.986
And he wants to love you.

920
01:46:40.986 --> 01:46:41.986
He wants to be your Lord.

921
01:46:41.986 --> 01:46:43.986
And He wants to be your Savior.

922
01:46:43.986 --> 01:46:45.986
And while all eyes are closed...

923
01:46:48.986 --> 01:46:51.986
I want to ask if you would think about that for a moment.

924
01:46:51.986 --> 01:46:54.986
Do I have Jesus in my life?

925
01:46:57.986 --> 01:46:59.986
All eyes closed.

926
01:46:59.986 --> 01:47:01.986
Do I have Jesus in my life?

927
01:47:01.986 --> 01:47:03.986
Is He my Lord?

928
01:47:03.986 --> 01:47:07.986
And Lord means, may He lead my life?

929
01:47:09.986 --> 01:47:13.986
Then I may see the words of the prayer.

930
01:47:13.986 --> 01:47:16.986
The closing prayer that I would like to express.

931
01:47:19.986 --> 01:47:23.986
If you see these words above you...

932
01:47:23.986 --> 01:47:30.986
Can you, in your faith, rationally, truly say yes with your faith?

933
01:47:30.986 --> 01:47:32.986
That is an important question.

934
01:47:32.986 --> 01:47:34.986
Do I believe what is written here?

935
01:47:34.986 --> 01:47:38.986
Please don't let it just be a religious prayer

936
01:47:38.986 --> 01:47:40.986
that we recite every time.

937
01:47:40.986 --> 01:47:42.986
This is not a little poem or a verse

938
01:47:42.986 --> 01:47:45.986
that you do every time to get off easily.

939
01:47:45.986 --> 01:47:47.986
This is having trust in Jesus.

940
01:47:47.986 --> 01:47:50.986
Having trust in Jesus, the King of Kings.

941
01:47:50.986 --> 01:47:52.986
His face is radiant like the sun.

942
01:47:52.986 --> 01:47:54.986
He has all authority.

943
01:47:54.986 --> 01:47:56.986
Shall we pray this together?

944
01:47:56.986 --> 01:47:58.986
Thank you, Jesus.

945
01:47:58.986 --> 01:48:01.986
I believe that you are the Son of God.

946
01:48:01.986 --> 01:48:05.986
I believe that you died on the cross for my sins.

947
01:48:05.986 --> 01:48:07.986
Forgive me all my mistakes.

948
01:48:07.986 --> 01:48:10.986
I invite you into my life, Jesus.

949
01:48:10.986 --> 01:48:12.986
Give me a new start.

950
01:48:12.986 --> 01:48:14.986
Help me to live for you.

951
01:48:14.986 --> 01:48:17.986
Today I am a child of God.

952
01:48:17.986 --> 01:48:19.986
Amen, amen.

953
01:48:19.986 --> 01:48:21.986
Let us sing for Him.

954
01:48:44.986 --> 01:48:48.986
Forever lifted high

955
01:48:48.986 --> 01:48:55.986
Your name cannot be overcome

956
01:48:55.986 --> 01:48:59.986
Cause your name is a light

957
01:48:59.986 --> 01:49:03.986
That the shadows can't deny

958
01:49:03.986 --> 01:49:10.986
Your name cannot be overcome

959
01:49:10.986 --> 01:49:14.986
And your name is alive

960
01:49:14.986 --> 01:49:18.986
Forever lifted high

961
01:49:18.986 --> 01:49:23.986
Your name cannot be overcome

962
01:49:23.986 --> 01:49:25.986
Sing it again, your name

963
01:49:25.986 --> 01:49:29.986
Cause your name is a light

964
01:49:29.986 --> 01:49:33.986
That the shadows can't deny

965
01:49:33.986 --> 01:49:40.986
And your name cannot be overcome

966
01:49:40.986 --> 01:49:44.986
And your name is alive

967
01:49:44.986 --> 01:49:48.986
Forever lifted high

968
01:49:48.986 --> 01:49:54.986
Your name will not be overcome

969
01:49:54.986 --> 01:49:56.986
Sing Jesus

970
01:49:56.986 --> 01:50:00.986
Jesus, Jesus

971
01:50:01.986 --> 01:50:04.986
You make the darkness tremble

972
01:50:04.986 --> 01:50:08.986
Jesus, Jesus

973
01:50:08.986 --> 01:50:11.986
You silence fear

974
01:50:11.986 --> 01:50:15.986
Jesus, Jesus

975
01:50:15.986 --> 01:50:19.986
You make the darkness tremble

976
01:50:19.986 --> 01:50:23.986
Jesus, Jesus

977
01:50:23.986 --> 01:50:26.986
Your name

978
01:50:26.986 --> 01:50:30.986
Cause your name is a light

979
01:50:30.986 --> 01:50:34.986
That the shadows can't deny

980
01:50:34.986 --> 01:50:41.986
And your name will not be overcome

981
01:50:41.986 --> 01:50:45.986
And your name is alive

982
01:50:45.986 --> 01:50:49.986
Forever lifted high

983
01:50:49.986 --> 01:50:55.986
Your name cannot be overcome

984
01:50:57.986 --> 01:51:01.986
What a wonderful teaching this is.

985
01:51:01.986 --> 01:51:04.986
Thank you.

986
01:51:05.986 --> 01:51:10.986
You know, you can come to the church and they only say

987
01:51:10.986 --> 01:51:14.986
You are nice, you are sweet, you are beautiful and blah blah blah.

988
01:51:14.986 --> 01:51:19.986
But that is actually just psychological nonsense, I would almost say.

989
01:51:19.986 --> 01:51:23.986
Teaching like this changes your life.

990
01:51:23.986 --> 01:51:25.986
So do something with it.

991
01:51:25.986 --> 01:51:28.986
That is what Tim wanted to emphasize as well.

992
01:51:28.986 --> 01:51:32.986
He said it too. How can I emphasize the weight of my words?

993
01:51:32.986 --> 01:51:37.986
To say, when you come to faith, that is the foundation.

994
01:51:37.986 --> 01:51:39.986
Vanessa told that a few weeks ago.

995
01:51:39.986 --> 01:51:41.986
That is the foundation. That is fine.

996
01:51:41.986 --> 01:51:46.986
Then you are saved, then you come to God in heaven, then you have eternal life.

997
01:51:46.986 --> 01:51:49.986
Fine, but that is the foundation. There is so much more.

998
01:51:49.986 --> 01:51:55.986
And precisely with this teaching, you can remove the filth from your life.

999
01:51:55.986 --> 01:52:00.986
And you can simply lead a pure and holy life.

1000
01:52:00.986 --> 01:52:04.986
Where God also provides in your life.

1001
01:52:04.986 --> 01:52:06.986
Through which you move forward.

1002
01:52:06.986 --> 01:52:12.986
Through which you receive a blessing and can also be a blessing to others.

1003
01:52:12.986 --> 01:52:15.986
So do something with it.

1004
01:52:15.986 --> 01:52:18.986
But well, that is already clear now.

1005
01:52:18.986 --> 01:52:22.986
Lord, thank you that your Word is so rich.

1006
01:52:22.986 --> 01:52:25.986
That it is so full. That there is so much in it.

1007
01:52:25.986 --> 01:52:29.986
Thank you, Lord, that for every situation in our lives.

1008
01:52:29.986 --> 01:52:32.986
There is an answer in your Word.

1009
01:52:32.986 --> 01:52:34.986
And that you provide answers.

1010
01:52:34.986 --> 01:52:37.986
Yes, even to our so-called modern issues.

1011
01:52:37.986 --> 01:52:40.986
There is simply an answer in your Word.

1012
01:52:40.986 --> 01:52:43.986
For your Word is so all-encompassing.

1013
01:52:43.986 --> 01:52:45.986
Lord, and we thank you for that.

1014
01:52:45.986 --> 01:52:47.986
Hallelujah, amen and amen.

1015
